			doc: '<path d="M5 4h14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Z"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5"/>',
